# Generated database types land here:
#
#     npm run db:types      ->  supabase/types/database.types.ts
#
# The file is generated, never hand-written (rules.md §5.3). It requires a linked
# project, so it cannot be produced until the migrations are pushed — see the
# handover notes for what is still blocked.
#
# Prince's lib/supabase/types.ts should re-export from the generated file rather
# than declaring its own table shapes.
